  "kanji": "亭",
  "completeCard": "---\nkanji: 亭\ntitle: pavilion; restaurant building\njlpt: 1\ntags: [jlpt-n1, grade-8, structure-unclassified]\nstrokes: 9\nradical: 亠\nradicalNumber: 8\nonyomi: [テイ, チン]\nkunyomi: []\nquizOnyomi: [テイ]\nquizKunyomi: []\ndistractors: [停, 京, 享]\n---\n\n# 亭 — pavilion; restaurant building\n\n**Strokes:** 9 · **Key (radical):** 亠 (the top dot and horizontal, no. 8) · **JLPT:** N1 (community list)\n\n## Meaning and origin\n\n亭 can refer to a pavilion or to a building used for dining or entertainment. In [料亭](../words/料亭.md) りょうてい, it points to a restaurant, not overnight accommodation. The whole word determines the kind of establishment.\n\n**Modern-shape mnemonic, not etymology:** Picture the 亠 cap and [口](口.md)-shaped box above a second roof-like 冖 and a long 丁-shaped support: a small pavilion with a tall central post. This is a memory scene for the modern shape, not a historical derivation.\n\n## Readings\n\n| Reading | Type | Typical words |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| テイ | on | [料亭](../words/料亭.md) りょうてい - traditional Japanese restaurant, especially an upscale one |\n| チン | on | 亭 ちん - a small pavilion for viewing or resting, for example in a garden; recognition example |\n\nPractice selects テイ. チン is an attested reading of the pavilion noun, not a missing or name-only reading; it is retained for recognition here. The source supplies no kun readings.\n\nThe suffix 亭 can also end some restaurant names and writers' or performers' pseudonyms. Those suffix senses use てい, not an interchangeable ちん.\n\n## Common words\n\n- [料亭](../words/料亭.md) りょうてい - traditional Japanese restaurant, especially an upscale one\n\n## Notes\n\n- [停](停.md), \"halt; stopping,\" adds the person-shaped 亻 on the left of 亭. A restaurant or pavilion is not the stopping action.\n- [京](京.md), \"capital,\" ends in 小, and [享](享.md), \"enjoy; receive benefits,\" ends in 子. 亭 instead has the covered 丁-shaped lower part.\n- 料亭 is not the lodging word [旅館](../words/旅館.md) りょかん. Nor does every restaurant use 亭 in its name.\n\nMetadata: [KANJIDIC2](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project), 2026-11-02 snapshot. Word pairs and reading-specific suffix senses: [JMdict](https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/JMdict-EDICT_Dictionary_Project), entries 1554300 and 2589430. Character meanings and the pavilion reading: [Digital Daijisen and Seisenban Nihon Kokugo Daijiten: 亭](https://kotobank.jp/word/%E4%BA%AD-569829).\n",
